@startuml scfen-queue
' SPEC: _spec/packages/starchess-core/scfen-queue.puml
' purpose: Queue ABNF, per-side shape (≤1 C + one special per unit, B and/or F), resolve order B < C < F then w then b.
!include ../../themes/proveo.puml

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

title SCFEN · Queue ABNF, Shape & Order

package "ABNF" {
  queue "queueField\n\"Q:\" sideQueue \";\" sideQueue" as QF <<async>>
  component "sideQueue\nside \":\" [action *(\",\" action)]\naction = special / classical\n(wire order = seq order)" as SQ <<async>>
  component "special\n(\"B\" / \"F\") \"=\" kind \":\" from\n[\":\" to [\":\" unit]]" as SP <<app>>
  component "classical\n\"C=\" from to [promotion]" as CL <<app>>
  component "kind\nspawn / stimStep / spiderMine /\nbishopSnipe / siegeMode / tacticalJump" as KD <<db>>
}

package "Shape & order" {
  component "Per side: ≤1 classical + **one special per unit**\n**before and/or after** it (B and F may mix)" as SHAPE <<async>>
  component "Resolve rank: B < C < F" as RANK <<app>>
  component "Then white, then black" as WB <<app>>
}

package "packages/starchess-core" {
  component "scfen/codec.ts\nformatQueueField / parseQueueField\nassertQueueShape / assertQueueGas" as COD <<app>>
  component "commands/queue-action.ts\naddScAction / removeScAction\naddScMove" as QACT <<async>>
}

QF ARROW_MAIN SQ : expands to two
SQ ARROW_OPTIONAL SP : may hold
SQ ARROW_OPTIONAL CL : may hold
SP ARROW_OPTIONAL KD : kind
CL ARROW_OPTIONAL KD : resolves to
COD ARROW_MAIN QF : serializes
QACT ARROW_MAIN COD : mutates snap.queue

note right of QF
  ""queueField = 'Q:' sideQueue ';' sideQueue""
end note

note right of SQ
  ""sideQueue = side ':' [ action *( ',' action ) ]""
  ""action    = special / classical""
  Order is free — the shape rules are **≤1 classical per side** and
  **one special per unit**. Specials may precede the C, follow it, or both,
  as long as each is a different unit:
  ""w:B=spiderMine:b4:b4,C=e2e3,F=siegeMode:e4"" is legal.
end note

note right of SP
  ""special = ('B' / 'F') '=' kind ':' from [ ':' to [ ':' unit ] ]""
end note

note right of CL
  ""classical = 'C=' from to [ promotion ]""
  King-shot actions encode ""to"" as intent (see scfen-wire).
end note

note right of KD
  ""kind = 'spawn' / 'stimStep' / 'spiderMine' /""
  ""       'charonMissiles' / 'siegeMode' / 'tacticalJump'""
end note

note bottom
  Ordering rules: **≤1 C per side** and **one special per unit** (keyed on
  ""from""). Timing is free — **B and/or F** — so a side may act before *and*
  after its own classical in one turn, on different units (gas budgets the rest).
  Resolve rank **B < C < F**, then **w then b**.
  F specials rewrite actor square to the unit's post-C position
  (move-then-gas lands on the destination).
end note
@enduml
